OL,3,GNEWSATheft of 'unique' #10k fountain
OL,4,Ainvestigated
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bronze fountain valued at #10,000 has
OL,7,Fbeen stolen from a garden, police say.
OL,9,FDetectives are investigating after the
OL,10,Fantique, which weighs about a tonne,
OL,11,Fwas taken from outside a home in
OL,12,FFisherton de la Mere, near Warminster
OL,13,Fin Wiltshire.
OL,15,FIt is believed the fountain, which
OL,16,Ffeatures cherubs and fish, was stolen
OL,17,Fbetween 8 October and 10 October.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
