OL,3,GNEWSATheft of 'unique' #10k fountain
OL,4,Ainvestigated
OL,5,
OL,6,FWiltshire Police want to hear from
OL,7,Fanyone who may spot the "elaborate" and
OL,8,F"unique" sculpture up for sale. In a
OL,9,Fstatement, it added: "We would also
OL,10,Flike to hear from you if you saw
OL,11,Fanything suspicious in the village
OL,12,Fduring the time it went missing."
